WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.466 --> 00:00:07.933
- Ah!
- Before you make your decision,

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.299
this is your Pokédex. Here.

3
00:00:11.366 --> 00:00:13.766
Wow, Professor, thanks very much!

4
00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:15.299
-Huh? It's on!

5
00:00:15.366 --> 00:00:17.900
If you point your Pokédex towards a Pokémon,

6
00:00:17.966 --> 00:00:20.066
it'll search for it automatically.

7
00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:22.166
Why not give it a try? -Okay.

8
00:00:24.366 --> 00:00:25.866
Hm.

9
00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:28.133
Fennekin, the Fox Pokémon.

10
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.133
Fennekin expels hot air that can reach nearly 400 degrees.

11
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.300
-It likes to snack on twigs.

12
00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:36.933
Amazing! And you're next.

13
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.199
Chespin, the Spiny Nut Pokémon.

14
00:00:39.266 --> 00:00:42.166
Chespin can flex the soft spikes on its head,

15
00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:45.699
making them so stiff and sharp, they can even pierce through stone.

16
00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:49.433
I get it. And finally...

17
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.666
Froakie, the Bubble Frog Pokémon.

18
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:55.233
From its chest and back, he creates bubbles called Frubbles,

19
00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.500
which act as a cushion and soften the blow of an opponent's attack.

20
00:00:58.566 --> 00:01:01.166
Wow! This'll come in handy.

21
00:01:01.233 --> 00:01:03.233
- Like it?
- Yes.

22
00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:06.166
Well then, go ahead and pick your partner.

23
00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:11.566
Um, they're all so cute, but I already made up my mind.

24
00:01:11.633 --> 00:01:14.833
You see, I knew who I wanted before I left the house.

25
00:01:18.533 --> 00:01:20.566
Hmm.

26
00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:24.466
Fennekin, I pick you. I'm Serena.

27
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.933
Fenn!

28
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.833
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

29
00:01:30.899 --> 00:01:34.533
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

30
00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:37.399
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

31
00:01:37.466 --> 00:01:40.266
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

32
00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:43.166
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

33
00:01:43.233 --> 00:01:46.500
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

34
00:01:46.566 --> 00:01:49.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

35
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.633
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

36
00:01:52.699 --> 00:01:54.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

37
00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:57.899
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

38
00:02:09.066 --> 00:02:12.233
Clemont and Bonnie joined Ash as he begins his journey

39
00:02:12.299 --> 00:02:14.500
to compete in the Kalos League.

40
00:02:14.566 --> 00:02:16.700
Now, our heroes are happily on their way

41
00:02:16.766 --> 00:02:19.100
to the Santalune City Gym.

42
00:02:20.066 --> 00:02:25.100
Pika. Pi.. Pika. Pika!

43
00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:28.866
There. All done. You're nice and clean.

44
00:02:28.933 --> 00:02:31.033
Brr! Pika, Pika!

45
00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.266
That's awesome. Thank you.

46
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:37.000
Aw, you don't have to thank me. I love doing this kind of stuff,

47
00:02:37.066 --> 00:02:38.900
because I love Pokémon.

48
00:02:40.933 --> 00:02:44.600
Hey Ash, does Pikachu like having its tail petted like that?

49
00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:48.700
Yeah, a whole lot!

50
00:02:48.766 --> 00:02:52.766
What a cutie pie! That's just what I'm going to do!

51
00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:55.133
-Looks like fun.

52
00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.200
Let me try.

53
00:02:57.266 --> 00:03:01.200
Hey Ash. Can you let Fletchling out? I want to take care of it.

54
00:03:01.266 --> 00:03:04.866
Okay. Fletchling, come on out!

55
00:03:04.933 --> 00:03:06.933
Fletchling! Fletch!

56
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.700
Hey Fletchling, do you mind if I clean your wings?

57
00:03:09.766 --> 00:03:13.233
- Fletchling!
- You're good at that, too.

58
00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:16.133
Fletchling loves having its wings cleaned.

59
00:03:17.799 --> 00:03:20.933
Taking care of Pokémon makes you really happy, doesn't it?

60
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.133
Yup.

61
00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.766
- Here.
- Pikachu.

62
00:03:26.833 --> 00:03:31.166
Ha. Well? Is that yummy Pokémon food?

63
00:03:31.233 --> 00:03:34.166
Pika Pika!

64
00:03:34.233 --> 00:03:38.399
Huh?

65
00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.799
Could that be the very same Dedenne?

66
00:03:43.866 --> 00:03:45.533
Yeah. The one who ran away.

67
00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.600
It must have been following us this whole time.

68
00:03:48.666 --> 00:03:51.966
- Pika! Pika!
- Come on Clemont, catch it, please?

69
00:03:52.033 --> 00:03:53.799
All right.

70
00:03:56.266 --> 00:03:58.799
- Denne!
- Come back!

71
00:04:00.633 --> 00:04:02.933
-Fletchling, follow it!

72
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.366
Fletchling!

73
00:04:07.133 --> 00:04:09.733
Dedenne, wait!

74
00:04:14.133 --> 00:04:16.733
- Did you lose it, Fletchling?
- Fletch! Fletchling!

75
00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:20.166
Dedenne! Where are you?

76
00:04:20.233 --> 00:04:22.566
Come out, come out, wherever you are!

77
00:04:22.633 --> 00:04:24.266
Huh?

78
00:04:24.333 --> 00:04:25.966
- Bonnie!

79
00:04:26.033 --> 00:04:29.033
- Huh?
- Dedenne.

80
00:04:29.099 --> 00:04:33.533
There you are! Oh! Hey! Wait!

81
00:04:33.599 --> 00:04:36.966
Bunnelby, get Dedenne out of that hole!

82
00:04:37.033 --> 00:04:40.700
- You too, Pikachu!
- Over there, come on!

83
00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.233
- Huh?
- Huh?

84
00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:46.733
- Over here?
- Pika!

85
00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.933
No, over there! Aha!

86
00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:56.733
- Whoa, that Dedenne sure is quick.
- Ah! I want it now!

87
00:05:05.533 --> 00:05:09.200
- Pika! Pika!
- Dedenne.

88
00:05:09.266 --> 00:05:11.333
Pika.

89
00:05:14.433 --> 00:05:17.233
Pika!

90
00:05:20.166 --> 00:05:22.466
Pikachu.

91
00:05:22.533 --> 00:05:25.066
Denne.

92
00:05:25.133 --> 00:05:28.333
Pika? Pikachu?

93
00:05:31.233 --> 00:05:33.099
Pika. Pika.

94
00:05:35.533 --> 00:05:36.833
Pika!

95
00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:39.366
-Pikachu!

96
00:05:39.433 --> 00:05:41.733
Denne.

97
00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.566
There's Pikachu.

98
00:05:43.633 --> 00:05:45.933
True. With a bonus Pokémon too.

99
00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.566
Yeah? What is it?

100
00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.000
Oh! It's a Dedenne, an Electric type.

101
00:05:55.066 --> 00:05:56.900
Never seen one before.

102
00:05:56.966 --> 00:05:59.433
They're having a back-and-forth buzz fest.

103
00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.500
Since they're both Electric types,

104
00:06:01.566 --> 00:06:03.866
I'd guess they're in the process of communicating.

105
00:06:03.933 --> 00:06:05.933
Ugh. Meowth, translation.

106
00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.866
No can do. I don't speak electricity.

107
00:06:10.866 --> 00:06:13.400
What luck. The Twerp's nowhere to be seen.

108
00:06:13.466 --> 00:06:15.866
Perfect. His loss is our gain.

109
00:06:15.933 --> 00:06:18.666
Huh? Hmm.

110
00:06:19.633 --> 00:06:22.933
- I think they're gone.
- Maybe it got away.

111
00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.666
- Bunnelby?
- Maybe.

112
00:06:24.733 --> 00:06:27.533
Pikachu hasn't come back either.

113
00:06:27.599 --> 00:06:32.000
Huh. Bunnelby, would you mind going back down there and looking for Pikachu?

114
00:06:32.066 --> 00:06:34.599
Bunn!

115
00:06:34.666 --> 00:06:36.799
Pikachu.

116
00:06:37.866 --> 00:06:39.900
Pika...

117
00:06:39.966 --> 00:06:42.433
-Pi...

118
00:06:43.766 --> 00:06:46.799
- Pika. Pika?
- Dedenne.

119
00:06:46.866 --> 00:06:50.000
Pika... Pika?

120
00:06:51.633 --> 00:06:56.700
Pikachu!

121
00:07:00.166 --> 00:07:01.799
Pika!

122
00:07:01.866 --> 00:07:05.299
- Pika.

123
00:07:05.366 --> 00:07:07.299
Pika! Pikachu!

124
00:07:14.533 --> 00:07:16.333
Pika? Pika. Pika!

125
00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:20.166
-Pikachu!

126
00:07:22.233 --> 00:07:24.900
Prepare for trouble, my prize Pikachu.

127
00:07:24.966 --> 00:07:27.166
And make it double, with Dedenne, too.

128
00:07:27.233 --> 00:07:29.666
To protect the world from devastation.

129
00:07:29.733 --> 00:07:32.733
To unite all people within our nation.

130
00:07:32.799 --> 00:07:35.799
To denounce the evils of truth and love.

131
00:07:35.866 --> 00:07:38.966
To extend our reach to the stars above.

132
00:07:39.033 --> 00:07:41.566
- Jessie.
- And James.

133
00:07:41.633 --> 00:07:44.466
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light.

134
00:07:44.533 --> 00:07:47.233
Surrender now or prepare for a fight.

135
00:07:47.299 --> 00:07:50.666
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

136
00:07:54.033 --> 00:07:58.066
Now, Pikachu, be a polite Pokémon and let us catch you.

137
00:07:58.133 --> 00:08:00.799
Dedenne, please. You, too.

138
00:08:00.866 --> 00:08:02.866
Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

139
00:08:02.933 --> 00:08:04.799
- Stop!
- How rude!

140
00:08:04.866 --> 00:08:06.333
- Take that!

141
00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:09.400
- Stop!
- And that! And this!

142
00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.233
Pikachu!

143
00:08:14.299 --> 00:08:17.166
- Wobbuffet, go!
- Wobbuffet!

144
00:08:19.066 --> 00:08:22.533
-Pika!

145
00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:28.299
Don't you ever get tired? Take a break!

146
00:08:28.366 --> 00:08:30.533
- For our sake!
- Chill!

147
00:08:32.799 --> 00:08:36.900
-How did it go, Bunnelby?

148
00:08:36.966 --> 00:08:38.500
Bunnelby.

149
00:08:38.566 --> 00:08:41.166
I guess you didn't find Pikachu, did you?

150
00:08:41.233 --> 00:08:44.900
I'm afraid Pikachu might have gotten lost wandering through all those tunnels.

151
00:08:44.966 --> 00:08:47.533
Clemont! We've just got to find Pikachu.

152
00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.300
Fletchling, look for Pikachu from the air.

153
00:08:50.366 --> 00:08:51.566
Fletch!

154
00:08:59.066 --> 00:09:00.966
- Give it up!
- Hey!

155
00:09:01.033 --> 00:09:04.266
Stop!

156
00:09:06.066 --> 00:09:09.766
Pika?

157
00:09:11.033 --> 00:09:14.966
Pikachu!

158
00:09:15.033 --> 00:09:18.466
Gotcha! Almost! Once more!

159
00:09:18.533 --> 00:09:21.566
Pika!

160
00:09:21.633 --> 00:09:24.033
-Pika!

161
00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:27.266
Dedenne!

162
00:09:28.733 --> 00:09:33.066
Oh, no! If this keeps up, they'll get away!

163
00:09:33.133 --> 00:09:34.766
We can't let that happen.

164
00:09:34.833 --> 00:09:37.733
Okay, Inkay. Hey, hey!

165
00:09:40.233 --> 00:09:43.600
- Ink! Inkay!
- Now tackle!

166
00:09:46.366 --> 00:09:50.900
- Pikachu!

167
00:09:52.133 --> 00:09:53.666
All right, Inkay, Psybeam!

168
00:09:53.733 --> 00:09:57.800
Inkay!

169
00:10:04.233 --> 00:10:08.666
- I give. where's Pikachu?
- Huh? Downstream!

170
00:10:08.733 --> 00:10:11.666
Pika! Pika!

171
00:10:11.733 --> 00:10:15.466
- They're getting away.
- But I've got just the thing.

172
00:10:15.533 --> 00:10:18.000
Our rubber Rocket raft!

173
00:10:19.533 --> 00:10:22.066
- That's some lifesaver.
- Like me.

174
00:10:22.133 --> 00:10:25.000
Wobba! Wobbuffet!

175
00:10:25.066 --> 00:10:28.000
Keep your powder dry, Pikachu. You'll be ours in no time!

176
00:10:28.066 --> 00:10:29.699
I can hardly breathe.

177
00:10:29.766 --> 00:10:31.933
So it's a little bit small. Deal with it.

178
00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:36.100
Concentrate on finding Pikachu.

179
00:10:36.166 --> 00:10:39.100
- Look! Pikachu alert.
- Wobba.

180
00:10:39.166 --> 00:10:42.666
Wait. Stop this bathtub. We floated right past!

181
00:10:42.733 --> 00:10:45.866
- Strong current, eh, Captain?
- Aye, aye, matey.

182
00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:04.766
Pikachu? Pika?!

183
00:11:05.866 --> 00:11:08.533
Pika! Pika!

184
00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:15.066
- Fletchling! Ling! Ling! Fletchling!
- Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

185
00:11:15.133 --> 00:11:17.733
- Pikachu!
- Pika!

186
00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:20.733
-I was so worried about you, buddy.

187
00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:23.733
Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

188
00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.533
-Huh?

189
00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:29.933
Dedenne!

190
00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.600
Who's that Pokémon?

191
00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.000
It's Dedenne!

192
00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:46.433
Dedenne? Dedenne?

193
00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.633
Now what are we going to do? I'm scared.

194
00:11:49.699 --> 00:11:51.566
What about the Pokémon Centre?

195
00:11:51.633 --> 00:11:53.666
I think we should treat Dedenne right here.

196
00:11:53.733 --> 00:11:55.666
Let's give it some electricity.

197
00:11:55.733 --> 00:11:59.133
- Electricity?
- How do we do that?

198
00:11:59.199 --> 00:12:01.733
Just leave it to me.

199
00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:06.233
Remember, the future is now, thanks to science!

200
00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:11.366
Clemontic Gear, on. I've got the perfect machine for a situation like this.

201
00:12:11.433 --> 00:12:14.733
Presenting my Electricity Generator!

202
00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:18.233
-Another boring name.

203
00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:22.400
Now observe. If you put a plastic clipboard under your arm

204
00:12:22.466 --> 00:12:24.699
and rub it like this.

205
00:12:24.766 --> 00:12:27.699
Huh? Wow!

206
00:12:27.766 --> 00:12:30.900
The resulting friction causes the build-up of electrons

207
00:12:30.966 --> 00:12:33.199
and creates static electricity, see?

208
00:12:33.266 --> 00:12:36.933
This brilliant machine uses that exact same principle,

209
00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:40.900
which allows it to create a massive electrical charge.

210
00:12:40.966 --> 00:12:42.966
And power... on!

211
00:12:47.533 --> 00:12:50.000
- Pika!
- Do you see the electricity?

212
00:12:50.066 --> 00:12:53.433
That's awesome! Science is so amazing!

213
00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.699
- You sure this is going to work?
- Sure I'm sure. Just watch.

214
00:13:07.199 --> 00:13:10.000
Dedenne!

215
00:13:10.066 --> 00:13:15.066
- Great. I think you can turn it off now.
- One problem. I can't!

216
00:13:15.133 --> 00:13:18.866
- Dedenne, get away, quick!

217
00:13:18.933 --> 00:13:23.166
- You've got to stop that thing!
- I wish I knew how!

218
00:13:23.233 --> 00:13:26.099
Whoa! Whoa! Ah!

219
00:13:32.666 --> 00:13:35.800
Whoopsie. I guess it's back to the drawing board.

220
00:13:35.866 --> 00:13:37.966
Yeah. Look at my hair.

221
00:13:38.033 --> 00:13:40.366
Denne! Denne! Denne!

222
00:13:40.433 --> 00:13:44.900
Hm. All right! Dedenne's sure feeling a lot better.

223
00:13:44.966 --> 00:13:47.266
-That's what counts.

224
00:13:47.333 --> 00:13:50.099
- All's well that ends well.
- Hm.

225
00:13:50.166 --> 00:13:54.266
Dedenne, I'm glad you're feeling all better now.

226
00:13:54.333 --> 00:13:56.233
Denne!

227
00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:57.966
- Huh?
- Denne! Denne!

228
00:13:58.033 --> 00:14:00.866
I think it's saying thanks for the electricity.

229
00:14:00.933 --> 00:14:03.099
Come on. You don't have to thank me.

230
00:14:04.099 --> 00:14:07.766
Huh? Clemont, Clemont! Catch it, catch it!

231
00:14:07.833 --> 00:14:11.199
Hey, that's right. I totally forgot about doing that.

232
00:14:11.266 --> 00:14:13.566
- Hold it right there!
- What?

233
00:14:13.633 --> 00:14:16.133
Now prepare for trouble! The "it" means you!

234
00:14:16.199 --> 00:14:20.233
- Yoo-hoo!
- Meanwhile, we'll just take Pikachu.

235
00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.466
Giving it to the Boss is the least we can do.

236
00:14:22.533 --> 00:14:26.633
By the way, if you're thinking of running, you've got another think coming.

237
00:14:26.699 --> 00:14:29.833
Wait a minute. This whole thing was your fault the whole time.

238
00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.566
Why are you guys always being so mean to Pokémon?

239
00:14:32.633 --> 00:14:36.066
Noisy, aren't you? Inkay, come on!

240
00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:41.133
Inkay!

241
00:14:41.199 --> 00:14:42.966
- Dedenne!
- Huh?

242
00:14:43.033 --> 00:14:45.933
Dedenne! You want to battle, don't you?

243
00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.166
So you can get back at them for what they did.

244
00:14:48.233 --> 00:14:51.733
- Denne!
- Great! Dedenne, tackle!

245
00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.500
Nah!

246
00:14:55.566 --> 00:14:58.033
Inkay! Use Foul Play.

247
00:14:58.099 --> 00:14:59.866
Ink!

248
00:15:03.199 --> 00:15:05.966
Now, Inkay, Psybeam, go!

249
00:15:06.033 --> 00:15:09.933
- Inkay!
- Look out!

250
00:15:13.433 --> 00:15:15.300
Dedenne, tackle one more time!

251
00:15:21.199 --> 00:15:24.966
You're doing great. All right, now use Nuzzle!

252
00:15:30.533 --> 00:15:34.500
Wow! That move's so cute! I like Dedenne even more!

253
00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:37.766
And better yet, Nuzzle paralyzes the other Pokémon.

254
00:15:37.833 --> 00:15:40.833
- No way!
- Yeah, Dedenne, way to go.

255
00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.699
Oh! Inkay!

256
00:15:42.766 --> 00:15:46.433
- Denne! Denne!
- Pikachu!

257
00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.199
Okay, Pikachu, you use Thunderbolt.

258
00:15:49.266 --> 00:15:51.733
And, Dedenne, you use Thunder Shock!

259
00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.733
- Pikachu!
- Dedenne!

260
00:15:57.466 --> 00:16:01.300
Oh.

261
00:16:04.966 --> 00:16:10.300
We're blasting off again!

262
00:16:11.966 --> 00:16:13.966
Pikachu, Dedenne, awesome.

263
00:16:14.033 --> 00:16:16.699
- Dedenne, you're the best.
- Thank you both.

264
00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:26.599
- Ah!
- Pika! Pika?

265
00:16:26.666 --> 00:16:29.133
- Dedenne!
- Pika! Pikachu!

266
00:16:29.199 --> 00:16:31.266
Dedenne really wants to come with us?

267
00:16:31.333 --> 00:16:34.466
Yeah? Really? Yippee!

268
00:16:34.533 --> 00:16:38.633
We'll have so much fun! You'll see!

269
00:16:38.699 --> 00:16:41.366
Denne?

270
00:16:41.433 --> 00:16:45.266
- Pretty please?
- Hmm. Yeah!

271
00:16:45.333 --> 00:16:48.366
Now it's time. Go Poké Ball!

272
00:16:48.433 --> 00:16:49.966
Denne!

273
00:16:58.599 --> 00:16:59.733
I did it!

274
00:17:03.233 --> 00:17:08.300
Yes! All right! I caught Dedenne and I'll be keeping it for Bonnie!

275
00:17:08.366 --> 00:17:10.966
This is so cool. Thank you!

276
00:17:11.033 --> 00:17:14.166
Hey, can you let Dedenne come out? I want to take care of it.

277
00:17:14.233 --> 00:17:15.899
Sure. I'll do it right now.

278
00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:22.566
- Denne!
- Dedenne! Yay!

279
00:17:22.633 --> 00:17:26.899
Hi there. I'm Bonnie. And see? That's my brother, Clemont.

280
00:17:26.966 --> 00:17:29.433
- Pika! Pikachu!
- That's Pikachu and Ash.

281
00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:32.500
- Nice to meet you!
- Denne! Denne!

282
00:17:32.566 --> 00:17:35.700
Here. Let me get you cleaned up.

283
00:17:35.766 --> 00:17:38.700
You got yourself all dirty from the battle.

284
00:17:38.766 --> 00:17:41.366
-Huh?

285
00:17:41.433 --> 00:17:44.933
Hey, look! Dedenne likes it when I pet its tail, too.

286
00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:48.433
- Wow. I never would have guessed.
- Pika! Pikachu! Pikachu!

287
00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.300
You both like the same thing!

288
00:17:53.566 --> 00:17:55.866
You two are just like twins!

289
00:17:55.933 --> 00:17:58.633
Well, they're both Electric types, remember?

290
00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:01.700
You're going to have fun with Dedenne. Aren't you, Bonnie?

291
00:18:01.766 --> 00:18:04.566
Yeah. Dedenne is so cute.

292
00:18:04.633 --> 00:18:06.766
Nuzzle, nuzzle, nuzzle!

293
00:18:06.833 --> 00:18:08.200
Denne!

294
00:18:08.266 --> 00:18:11.800
Nuzzle's one of Dedenne's moves. I guess she forgot.

295
00:18:11.866 --> 00:18:16.933
Yup. And now I can feel what it's like to be paralyzed.

296
00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:22.600
Huh? It fell asleep.

297
00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:26.733
Of course. You see, Dedenne tend to fall asleep a lot.

298
00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:29.933
That's just one of the things they do to conserve their energy.

299
00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.366
- Awesome! An energy saver!
- Ah.

300
00:18:33.433 --> 00:18:38.000
Okay, you can take a nap in here.

301
00:18:40.266 --> 00:18:43.633
- So, let's get going.
- Right, let's hit the road.

302
00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.333
Yeah!

303
00:18:45.399 --> 00:18:47.466
- Shh.
- Pikachu.

304
00:18:52.666 --> 00:18:56.333
And so, after escaping Team Rocket's evil clutches,

305
00:18:56.399 --> 00:19:00.566
Pikachu and Dedenne are safe and Dedenne's back to perfect health.

306
00:19:00.633 --> 00:19:05.333
Following Clemont's successful catch, our heroes have a new friend,

307
00:19:05.399 --> 00:19:08.766
as the Kalos region journey continues.

308
00:19:13.366 --> 00:19:16.166
Oh! This is terrible.

309
00:19:16.233 --> 00:19:19.366
The sun's setting and we're still in the middle of the woods.

310
00:19:19.433 --> 00:19:20.966
- Fenne?
- Wait!

311
00:19:21.033 --> 00:19:24.899
Does this mean we're sleeping out in the open tonight? Hm?

312
00:19:24.966 --> 00:19:28.399
-Uh, roughing it's not my style.

313
00:19:29.399 --> 00:19:31.700
If we could find a Pokémon Centre,

314
00:19:31.766 --> 00:19:34.566
there's no doubt we'd be able to stay there.

315
00:19:34.633 --> 00:19:36.666
But I don't know where it is.

316
00:19:37.899 --> 00:19:40.600
Ah! I see somebody.

317
00:19:40.666 --> 00:19:46.700
Excuse me! Can you please tell us if there's a Pokémon Centre close by?

318
00:19:47.766 --> 00:19:49.766
Oh!

319
00:19:49.833 --> 00:19:53.266
Beetle!

320
00:19:54.366 --> 00:19:56.466
-Fenne!

321
00:19:56.533 --> 00:20:00.033
- Oh!
- Fennekin!

322
00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:13.399
- Ah! Thanks, Fennekin. You saved me!
- Fenne!

323
00:20:13.466 --> 00:20:15.200
- Is everything okay?
- Huh?

324
00:20:15.266 --> 00:20:20.433
- I just heard somebody screaming.
- Ah! Nurse Joy!

325
00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.100
I just got a little startled by a Pokémon.

326
00:20:23.166 --> 00:20:26.300
Oh, I understand. But are the two of you all right?

327
00:20:26.366 --> 00:20:31.200
Yup. Hey, could you tell me if there's a Pokémon Centre around here, please?

328
00:20:31.266 --> 00:20:34.766
Yes. It's located just up ahead.

329
00:20:34.833 --> 00:20:37.200
Thank goodness. Hmm.

330
00:20:37.266 --> 00:20:41.399
Fennekin, we're going to stay at a Pokémon Centre tonight!

331
00:20:41.466 --> 00:20:45.466
I know! Let's have a race to see who gets there first!

332
00:20:45.533 --> 00:20:47.533
Fennekin!
